# Offline: the wrapper gates the card on wifi_is_up -> NO server probe, NO card, and the
# game still launches. Nothing ever claims "no saves" (the probes never ran).
desc launch card: offline -> no probe, no card, game still launches
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi down
sdfile+ Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_exit 0
expect_trace_absent ENGINE --list-saves
expect_trace_absent PROMPT[
expect_trace STOCK GBA rom=
